// A score built ONLY of `tab … as numbers` — the bare TabStaff, which draws no time
// signature — carrying a MID-PIECE meter change at bar 3. It must reserve nothing for it:
// LilyPond BLANKS the meter's stencil rather than removing the engraver
// (ly/engraver-init.ly TabStaff, \override TimeSignature.stencil = ##f), so the grob has an
// empty X extent and both walks that could charge for it step over it —
// break-alignment-interface.cc calc_positioning_done and
// spacing-interface.cc extremal_break_aligned_grob.
//
// ⚠️ WHAT THIS BOOK GUARDS, so a later reader can poison it: TimeSignatureChangeItem.Blanked
// and SpacingRules.ChangeItemHasInk. Kill either and the fret digits from bar 3 on move
// right — this book's SVG changes. (Verified by poisoning both, session 202.)
//
// ⚠️ WHY IT EXISTS AT ALL. The defect's scope is ZERO books: nothing in the 566 writes a
// mid-piece meter on a numbers-only tab, which is why fixing it re-based no snapshot. But a
// scope of zero also means nobody was watching, and the ledger points that closed it
// (mid-piece.tab-numbers.*) are geometry probes carrying their own sources. This is the
// corpus's own observer.
//
// ⚠️ THE MID-MEASURE HALF IS DELIBERATELY NOT HERE. A meter change INSIDE a bar leaves that
// bar disagreeing with one of the two meters by construction — Lily# says so (LYS2001) and
// LilyPond fails its bar check on the same music — so putting one in a corpus book would
// add a permanent warning to the corpus to observe a rule its own diagnostics already
// dispute. That half is observed by the ledger point mid-measure.tab-numbers.meter-identity
// and by TabOnlyMeterColumnTests.ABlankedMeterInsideABar_IsNotAChangeColumn.
//
// The default `tab` is FULL notation and does engrave a meter — the control for this book is
// test/timesig-change, which draws its changes on a notation staff.
title "Numbers-only tab, mid-piece meter"
octave absolute
time 4/4

part gt { instrument guitar }

section Main {
  gt {
    c4 e g e | c4 e g e |
    time 2/4 c4 e | c4 e |
    time 3/8 c8 e g | c8 e g |
  }
}

form main { Main }

score main "tab-numbers-meter-change" { tab gt as numbers }
